                  "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                  "Text": "These data are from an experiment with ferilizer on very shallow soils with moderate rainfall. Substantial rates of accumulated N applications changed the C-N dynamics of the site and stand growth. Data were reported in [#neilsen1992growth]  and [#neilsen1998implications], and some details were checked in the original files with permission of the current manager of the site (Sustainable Timber Tasmania).\n\n\n",
