                      "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                      "Text": "These data were kindly provided by Hancock Queensland Plantations (HQPlantations) from Experiment 251 MBR, which was established to investigate the impact of various 2R site preparation methods at a high-mounded first rotation (1R) site with hard-setting soil in south-east Queensland. As the model was not designed to simulate various details of each treatment, only one of the best performing treatments was simulated (Experiment 251MBR, Treatment F1-MB6). \n\n\n",
