                  "Name": "SETRES",
                  "ResourceName": null,
                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                      "Text": "These data are from an experiment of 2x nutrient and water treatments in _P. taeda_ near Sandhills, North Carolina, USA. As nutrients other than N were probably limiting in some treatments, which the the model couold not be expected to simulate, only the high input treatment was simualted.  \r\n\nNumerous publications report on this experiment, of which we drew on [#zhao2016maximum], [#landsberg2001applying], [#albaugh2009opportunities], [#albaugh2004long], and [#albaugh1998leaf].\n\n\n",
                      "Name": "Memo",
                      "ResourceName": null,
                      "Children": [],
                      "Enabled": true,
                      "ReadOnly": false
                    },
